## Access / assets (all done)
- **Root on the mower** (RK3588, Ubuntu 20.04, ROS Noetic) via `ssh airseekers@192.168.1.105` (pw `airseek123`) → `sudo -i`, and `ssh root@…` (pw `airseek123` / your keys). Set by flashing `rootfs.mod.img` back with `rkdeveloptool` (loader: `tools/rkbin/rk3588_loader_v1.24.114.bin`, rootfs LBA 13664256). OG image preserved as `rootfs.img`.
