## Working capabilities
- **Local control over Foxglove bridge** (`ws://192.168.1.105:8765`): `/controller/ctrl` args **`stop`/`pause`/`resume`** verified on hardware (`fox_ctrl.py <arg>`). Also `/controller/dock/ctrl`, `/cutter_control` ({enable,direction,int32 speed,int8 position}), `/cmd_vel` teleop.
- **Cameras**: `web_video_server` (MJPEG) works. Front = `/vio/left`+`/vio/right` (always on). Rear/OA need `start_capture`. Confirmed a live frame off-device.
- **HA integration** (`airseekers-tron-ha-local`): added `call_service`/`publish` to `foxglove_client.py`, docs updated, and **motor/telemetry sensors** in `sensor.py` (cutter/left/right/height × rpm/temp/current/status). Uncommitted; tests not run (no uv here).
- **PyAirseekers**: added read-only cloud endpoints + `move_control` + MQTT doc + proto catalogue. Uncommitted; run `uv run pytest tests/unit/cloud`.
- **Streaming/persistence doc**: `airseekers-decompile/docs/streaming-and-telemetry.md`.

## OPEN THREAD — "start a mow" (pick up here)
No single Foxglove service starts a mow; it's orchestrated by `mower_logic`. Two routes:
1. **Easiest — mower_logic HTTP API** (localhost-only on device): `POST /task/start {"mapName":"<name>.geojson"}`, plus GET `/task/{pause,resume,stop,dock,unDock}`, `/map/list`. Port TBD (sim uses 12346; find with `ss -ltnp` / it wasn't on 12346 live — check the running node). Expose to HA with `socat TCP-LISTEN:8088,fork TCP:127.0.0.1:<port>` + HA `rest_command`.
2. **Pure Foxglove** — replay the behavior-tree sequence: load map → `/controller/SetTaskParams` (UpdateNavParams) → `/planning/task_set` (PlannerTaskSet) / `/planning/coverage` → `/controller/SetTypePath` → `/controller/ctrl resume`. Reference trees: `src/mower_task/mower_bt_nodes/behaviors_master/*.xml` (esp. `mower_logic_master.xml`). Needs the message schemas filled in — more work.

