==== README metoak
# Metoak stereo SDK — recovery

`src/mower_perception/vslam_ros/3rdparty/metoak/` is the closed-source **Metoak** stereo
depth-camera SDK that `stereo_ros` (and downstream `as_vio_node` VIO) is built on. Its own
headers were **not** shipped, but the binaries reconstruct the full internal structure.

## Artifacts

| File | Size | State | Recovered |
|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/libMoGeneralSDK_static.a` | 3.8 MB | **not stripped** (`.symtab`) | 65 source filenames + ~3048 demangled funcs |
| `lib/libMoGeneralSDK.so.2.7.5.{2,9,10}` | 1.6 MB | stripped | 1961 exported funcs |
| `lib/libmoMowerAPI.so.1.0.3` | 2.8 MB | stripped | 8645 exported funcs |
| `bin/basic_sample` | 1.8 MB | **not stripped** (`.symtab`) | 1987 funcs — live SDK usage example |

## Recovered source layout (from the static archive's object names)

`ar t` on `libMoGeneralSDK_static.a` yields the exact original `.cpp`/`.c` filenames — 65
files. Highlights (`native_decompile/metoak/MoGeneralSDK.sources.txt`):

* **Camera HAL** — `MoCamera.cpp`, `MoLocalCamera.cpp`, `MoLocalUsbCamera.cpp`,
  `MoLocalMipiCamera.cpp`, `MoLocalTcpCamera.cpp`, `MoLocalMsgCamera.cpp`,
  `MoLocal*V4l2Manager.cpp`, `MoLocalSdkInterface.cpp`, `MoHardwareAccess.cpp`
* **Sensors** — `MoSensor.cpp`, `MoCmosSensor.cpp`, `MoIspSensor.cpp`, `MoSimorSensor.cpp`
* **Stereo/depth post-process** — `filter_and_dense.cpp`, `cca_filter.cpp`,
  `repeat_texture.cpp`, `MoAdjustLineOffset.cpp`, `MoAdjustDO`/`MoAdjustLO` (auto-calib)
* **Streaming/messaging** — `MoStreamManager.cpp`, `MoMsgManager.cpp`,
  `MoTcpMsgManager.cpp`, `MoUartMsgManager.cpp`, `MoUVCMsgManager.cpp`, `MoShareMem.cpp`
* **Event/handlers** — `MoCamEventManager.cpp`, `MoCamEventHandler.cpp`,
  `MoOccAndAecHandler.cpp`, `MoMeta5AecHandler.cpp`, `MoNoImgHandler.cpp`,
  `MoTemperatureEventHandler.cpp`, `MoPassiveLogger.cpp`
* **Peripheral** — `MoImuDriver.c`, `lz4.c`, `MoTrigDriver.cpp`, `MoException.cpp`, `MoENV.cpp`

## Recovered API (from demangled symbols)

`native_decompile/metoak/MoGeneralSDK.api.txt` groups every function by its source file.
The headline class is `MoCamera` (`Init/OpenCamera/CloseCamera/StartStream/StopStream/
SuspendCamera/ResumeCamera/RestartStream`, `GetIMUData`, `GetSerialNumber`,
`GetSensorInfoList`, `GetTemperatureList`, `Get/SetAERangeLevel`, `Enable/Disable/
Set/GetOcclusionCheck*`, `FPGARead/Write`, `FlashRead/WritePage`, `EPRUpgrade`,
